| Net Taxable Income | Tax Rate |
|---|---:|
| 0–150,000 THB | 0% |
| 150,001–300,000 THB | 5% |
| 300,001–500,000 THB | 10% |
| 500,001–750,000 THB | 15% |
| 750,001–1,000,000 THB | 20% |
| 1,000,001–2,000,000 THB | 25% |
| 2,000,001–5,000,000 THB | 30% |
| Above 5,000,000 THB | 35% |

Official reference:
https://www.rd.go.th/26218.html

The above is a progressive marginal rate schedule, not a flat rate applied to the entire income amount.

